{"product":{"id":15851957158262,"title":"Accessory Pack","body_html":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis accessory pack includes a selection of items designed to expand your experience with Microduck, explore new interactions, and create new experiments.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe pack includes:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2 × Rollers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, to explore new ways of moving. Choose the color that best matches your robot. We recommend orange for Cream and Sky, and yellow for Graphite and Lavender robots.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1 × Laser\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e,\u003cspan\u003e for pointing-based interactions and activities.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1 × NFC Polaroid\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, a \u003c\/span\u003e1.54-inch color NFC-powered E-Ink display\u003cspan\u003e you can carry anywhere. Tap it on your robot’s head to discover what your robot is dreaming about.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e10 × NFC Tags\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, create custom interactions, triggers, and behaviors using NFC.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1 × Ball\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, perfect for creating games, and challenges.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA complete accessory pack designed to help you \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eplay, experiment, code, and create new experiences\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e with your robot.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u